OL,3,GNEWSAMan dies in hospital following
OL,4,Atwo-car crash in North Uist
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 43-year-old man has died following a
OL,7,Ftwo-car crash on the A867 in North Uist
OL,8,Fon Wednesday night.
OL,10,FPolice said the man was taken to Queen
OL,11,FElizabeth Hospital in Glasgow where he
OL,12,Fdied a short time later.
OL,14,FA 36-year-old man was taken to hospital
OL,15,Fin Benbecula.
OL,17,FThe collision happened at about 21:00
OL,18,Fand the A867 has been closed between
OL,19,FLochmaddy and Clachan to allow for a
OL,20,Fpolice investigation.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
